<title>HONG KONG: Great Wall shares suspended from trading.</title>
<headline>Great Wall shares suspended from trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Great Wall Electronic International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Its shares rose HK$0.04 or 7.84 percent in the last two trading days to HK$0.55 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The electronic products manufacturer had said earlier its 39.7 percent controlling shareholder was in talks to sell a stake in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
